#, no-wrap
msgid "[Shor's algorithm](/tutorials/shors-algorithm)\n"
msgstr "[Algoritmul lui Shor](/tutorials/shors-algorithm)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Grover's algorithm](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm)\n"
msgstr "[Algoritmul lui Grover](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm)\n"

